SUMMARY:Pride Under the Stars
DESCRIPTION:Join North Jersey Pride\, South Orange Downtown\, and South Orange Village for Pride Under the Stars on Friday\, June 12 from 7PM – 11PM in Spiotta Park (20-32 Village Plaza South Orange\, NJ). Celebrate Pride with an unforgettable night of music\, dancing\, and community in the heart of downtown South Orange. \nDance under the stars with high energy music from DJ Redline\, enjoy a cash bar\, and experience a vibrant evening welcoming all ages. Guests 21+ can purchase alcoholic beverages. \nAdmission is free\, with a suggested $20 donation supporting North Jersey Pride and its mission to uplift and advocate for the LGBTQ+ community across New Jersey. Grab your friends\, bring the family\, and come celebrate Pride together all night long. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
