SUMMARY:The Gutter Kings Tearin' it up at Tierney's!
DESCRIPTION:The Gutter Kings return to Tierney’s Tavern in #MontclairNJ for more musical mayhem! Join Scott\, Tony\, Nelson\, and Cory on SATURDAY\, JUNE 13\, as we hit you with action-packed rock classics from the 60s-70s-80s and beyond – not the same old bar-band tunes!\nCome early for dinner – the kitchen always has some amazing burgers and other bar goodies. Then head upstairs and join us for a fun night of LIVE music!\nDoors open at 8pm – $10 admission. We’ll be collecting non-perishable food items in memory of our late brother Andy McGuire (of The Fabulous Flemtones) for Toni’s Kitchen in Montclair. Bring a food donation for half off admission. Visit https://toniskitchen.org/give-goods/ for more info on how to donate.\nThere is free parking (on-site and nearby). Get yer dancin’ shoes on and come on out to Tierney’s Tavern on 6/13/2026!\n136-138 Valley Road\, Montclair\, NJ 07042 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/the-gutter-kings-tearin-it-up-at-tierneys-2/
LOCATION:Tierney’s Tavern\, 136 Valley Road\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GK.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Toni's Kitchen":MAILTO:toniskitchen@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
