SUMMARY:Second Sunday Concert: Gerard & Diane Barros
DESCRIPTION:June 14\, 2:00 PM Country & Western Hoedown on the terrace \nGerard & Diane Barros are a unique husband and wife / keyboard and guitar duo\, specializing in 2- part harmonies\, playing tunes. from the 1940s to 2000s. With an “old school duo” approach to playing instruments and singing\, this versatile pair of musicians provides great entertainment with an eclectic/retro setlist that consists of more than 60 years’ worth of some of the best popular music. \nPlease bring a blanket or lawn chairs for this outdoor concert behind Van Vleck House. The event is weather-dependent so please check our website and your email if the forecast is uncertain.\nReservations are recommended. Walk-ins without reservations will be seated on a space-available basis. \nThis concert is free but a donation of $10 at the door is greatly appreciated to support the series. \nThanks to our series patrons for their support this season. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/second-sunday-concert-gerard-diane-barros/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GD-Country-Pic2.jpg
END:VEVENT
